// Generic mod hooks: tags / gameplay events the mod reports WITHOUT hand-written AngelScript.
// tools/gen_hooks.py turns the enabled groups into Mod/.../DualSenseBridge_Generated.as (+ haptics/registry.generated.json).
// tags:   owned gameplay tag on the player's ability system -> "<type>:start" when added, "<type>:complete" when removed
// events: gameplay event received by the player's actor      -> "<type>:start" with mag=<event magnitude>
// type (optional): event type name [a-z0-9_]; default = tag without "State."/"Event."/"Action.", dots -> "_", lower case.
// Disable a group ("enabled": false) and regenerate to roll it back (rules for it then simply stop firing).
{
  "groups": [
